  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>Common beliefs about choosing a career, such as having one right answer or marks deciding everything, can mislead, and each can be tested with a small fact or a short trial before it shapes a big decision.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
